  m_Name: Globe thistle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequence:
  - text: '                                    '
    displayText: '                                    '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 4
      parameter:
      - RoomEnd Door1 Open
    - index: 0
      functionType: 5
      parameter:
      - RoomEnd Door1
    - index: 0
      functionType: 1
      parameter:
      - OpenDoor
    - index: 0
      functionType: 4
      parameter:
      - RoomEnd Door1 Light
  - text: '```"I choose to live."'
    displayText: '"I choose to live."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya said it first, $$but Rika's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. $$They made the same choice.
    displayText: Maya said it first, but Rika's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. They made the same choice.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 14000000140000004d0000004d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I.$.$.I cannot forgive anyone. $$Not me. $$Not them.
    displayText: I...I cannot forgive anyone. Not me. Not them.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 02000000030000001d0000001d0000002500000025000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You don't have to.
    displayText: You don't have to.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6ba46ecacc866544da47236fc876b59f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The world breaks me and everyone else. $$And it will keep breaking us until
      we have nothing left.
    displayText: The world breaks me and everyone else. And it will keep breaking
      us until we have nothing left.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2700000027000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It probably will.
    displayText: It probably will.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ec1ce6e63321a941829a1566caac4f2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Nothing will get better. $$People of the past had hoped, $$but those hopes
      never came true.
    displayText: Nothing will get better. People of the past had hoped, but those
      hopes never came true.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 708777bab44cd2f45b2812ba56f77be9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 19000000190000003700000037000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Even if an old kind of pain stops, $$a new pain will always come.
    displayText: Even if an old kind of pain stops, a new pain will always come.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b4e91975d53cca641b0139806b4b5627, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2300000023000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Then.$.$.Why do we choose to live, $$Maya?
    displayText: Then...Why do we choose to live, Maya?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 05000000060000002100000021000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's because we despise this world.
    displayText: It's because we despise this world.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b4e91975d53cca641b0139806b4b5627, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Life is painful. $$Nothing goes as expected.
    displayText: Life is painful. Nothing goes as expected.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1100000011000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But Rika has survived for more than 2 decades, $$living, $$breathing in
      the air of this ugly world.
    displayText: But Rika has survived for more than 2 decades, living, breathing
      in the air of this ugly world.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2f0000002f0000003700000037000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She has lived this long out of spite. $$Why stop now?
    displayText: She has lived this long out of spite. Why stop now?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2600000026000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika looked at the weathered down door, $$at the globe thistles growing
      through the cracks.
    displayText: Rika looked at the weathered down door, at the globe thistles growing
      through the cracks.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2800000028000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: That flower's so ugly.
    displayText: That flower's so ugly.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I hate it.
    displayText: I hate it.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b4e91975d53cca641b0139806b4b5627, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Me too.
    displayText: Me too.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.Let's go.
    displayText: ...Let's go.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: They walked towards the door. $$This is the final choice they made by themselves,
      $$and the only choice that will satisfy her.
    displayText: They walked towards the door. This is the final choice they made
      by themselves, and the only choice that will satisfy her.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000005000000050000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The door doesn't open easily. $$Rika pulled hard against the rusty chain
      to force it open.
    displayText: The door doesn't open easily. Rika pulled hard against the rusty
      chain to force it open.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The chain made a loud screech as it snapped.
    displayText: The chain made a loud screech as it snapped.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika and Maya slowly fused into one, $$and.$.$.
    displayText: Rika and Maya slowly fused into one, and...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2500000025000000290000002a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '                                                                                      '
    displayText: '                                                                                      '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
